        "original_id": "60dbf92d-1b1d-5155-b75d-79b5ef359c87",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Liz Rose, Taylor Swift, Nathan Chapman\n- Songs: \"White Horse,\" \"Teardrops on My Guitar,\" \"You Belong with Me,\" \"Picture to Burn\"\n- Companies: Big Machine Records\n- Albums: Fearless\n- Awards: Grammy Award\n\nFacts:\n- Liz Rose co-wrote twenty of Taylor Swift's officially released songs and singles, including \"White Horse,\" \"Teardrops on My Guitar,\" and \"You Belong with Me.\"\n- \"White Horse\" was released on December 7, 2008 by Big Machine Records as the second single from Taylor Swift's second studio album Fearless (2008).\n- \"Picture to Burn\" was co-written by Taylor Swift and Liz Rose, and Nathan Chapman produced it.\n- Liz Rose and Taylor Swift won a Grammy Award in 2010 for \"You Belong with Me.\"",
